les from our customers run them on  on their behalf and return the raw  images to them that the customer in  turns interprets a typical project flow  lasts between three or four month  depending on the level of multiplexing  and the complexity of the underlying  markers to conclude I will leave you  with a typical example of a pilot study  in this case the seven planks acquired  in NS CLC FFPE samples looking at CD 3  cd4 cd8 granzin B TT f1p d1 and that be  the corresponding raw images were  formatted to be analyzed on the halo  platform for further cell segmentation I  hope you've enjoyed this webinar feel  free to visit our website and to reach  out to us for any questions thank you
 

